  "primary_scale": "AT32F421G8U7, QFN-28 body 4x4 mm. Artery DS_AT32F421_V2.02_EN, section 6.5, Table 50: https://www.arterychip.com/download/DS/DS_AT32F421_V2.02_EN.pdf",
  "method": [
    "SIFT low-profile feature matches on board ROIs, MAGSAC consensus homographies. 8914 body corners transferred into 8915; 8908/09 and AD supply full envelope. A degenerate automatic 8920->AD fit was rejected; 11 actual solder annuli/bores tie 8920 to AD.",
    "Rectifying model separates two board axes using long mask edges, crest contact centers and B/F end edge. Robust least squares fits two perspective terms, axis shears and metric scales to the 4 mm QFN; 1.27 mm flash pitch is a weaker dimensional cross-check. Edge-mask planes differ from raised package tops.",
    "Parameter intervals include extrapolation, lens distortion, partial obscuration, stage-to-stage variation. Fit RMS is in pixels and is NOT a caliper tolerance. Nominal values rounded to 0.1 mm.",
    "Thickness: exposed laminate bands IMG_8914, 8921, 8908. Approximate plane-pose tilt vs edge (roughly 13/8.2, 12/8.4 and 20/12.3 px per mm); near-normal ill-conditioned 8909 not used. 1.45 +/-0.45 mm.",
    "8915 overlay homography uses only 4 crest + 4 aux planar circular pads, with independent package-center checks. Package clicks are on top faces, so residual includes parallax. Origins of actual CAD nodes are supplied, no rendered screenshot as geometry."
  ],
